  tip:"Draw the stretch reflex arc (spindle, Ia afferent, dorsal root, alpha motor neuron, muscle) with the gamma motor neuron loop. Separately draw the bladder with its three nerves (pelvic S2-4, hypogastric T11-L2, pudendal S2-4) and the pontine centre above. A simple gate diagram (large fibre, small fibre, SG cell, T cell) earns marks in the pain part.",
