  mnemonic:{word:"S2-4 keeps the floor", items:[["Para","Parasympathetic S2-4 pees (detrusor)"],["Symp","Sympathetic T11-L2 stores"],["Pud","Pudendal S2-4 holds (external sphincter)"]], extra:"Spasticity = speed-dependent clasp-knife (UMN); Rigidity = lead pipe or cogwheel (basal ganglia)."},
  example:"A 34-year-old man with T8 complete paraplegia after a fall in Erode develops reflex bladder leaks and leg spasms with quick stretch. The physiotherapist explains the reflex arc behind the spasms, uses slow stretch and standing, and coordinates intermittent catheterisation with the nursing team.",
