  example:"A 9-year-old boy in Villupuram recovers from tuberculous meningitis with a VP shunt, left hemiparesis and hearing loss. The physiotherapist starts positioning, stretching of the calf, sitting balance and walking practice, and teaches parents to report vomiting or drowsiness that may mean shunt block.",
